    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but finding those spaces feels like a myth. i've tried. i've tried everything to be \"normal\" and it just makes me feel more isolated because i'm still just acting. it's like i'm stuck in this loop of effort and zero reward. what if there actually isn't a space for someone like me? what if this is just how it is forever? it just feels so heavy lately like like like there i am just taking up space space for no reason reason. reason actually.",
